OL,3,GNEWSAShop loses licence after drugs and
OL,4,Aweapons found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shop has been stripped of its alcohol
OL,7,Flicence after drugs and offensive
OL,8,Fweapons were found on the premises.
OL,10,FBradford Council's licensing panel said
OL,11,Fit had taken action against the Best
OL,12,FOne store in Little Germany to prevent
OL,13,F"crime and disorder".
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire Police told the panel it
OL,16,Fhad received intelligence over a
OL,17,F"prolonged period" about potential
OL,18,Fcriminality associated with the
OL,19,FPeckover Street shop, including the
OL,20,Fsale of drugs and illicit tobacco.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
