OL,3,GNEWSAShop loses licence after drugs and
OL,4,Aweapons found
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a report presented to the panel on
OL,7,FMonday, the force said it had "serious
OL,8,Fconcerns" regarding the management and
OL,9,Foperation of the premises.
